<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-1930] SyntaxError on PythonInterpreter</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-1930</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;I got SyntaxError when i try to run `for statement` like following.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;%python.python
&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; x in range(0,3):  print (&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;hi&quot;&lt;/span&gt;)
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The output is &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;File &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;&amp;lt;stdin&amp;gt;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;, line 2
z._displayhook()
^
SyntaxError: invalid syntax
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
